  "ha": {"copyLanguage":"ha","localizationStatus":"machine-accepted","localizationAcceptedBy":"site-owner","localizationAcceptedAt":"2026-10-13","name":"Asalin Sunan Generator","title":"Fantasy Name Generator Kyauta | UsefulVerse","description":"Ƙirƙirar sunaye masu ban sha'awa, ra'ayoyin kasuwanci ko sunayen mai amfani tare da iri mai sake amfani da su. Kyauta, babu asusu, babu da'awar samuwa.","intro":"Yi sabon jerin sunaye-salon fantasy, ra'ayoyin sunan kasuwanci ko sunayen mai amfani. Saita iri don sake fitar da jeri, ko canza shi zuwa wani zane.","howQuestion":"Yaya janareta sunan ke aiki?","howAnswer":"Zaɓi salon suna, ƙidayar sakamako da maɓallin zaɓi na zaɓi, sannan ƙirƙira. Iri yana sa saituna iri ɗaya za su sake haifuwa. Sakamako sun fito daga ginanniyar kalma da lissafin haruffa kuma shawarwari ne, ba ingantattun sunaye ba.","privacyQuestion":"Shin wannan janareta yana duba sunayen kasuwanci ko sunayen masu amfani akan layi?","privacyAnswer":"A'a. Ana yin komai a cikin wannan mai binciken. Ba ya bincika rajistar alamar kasuwanci, dandamalin zamantakewa ko sabis na yanki, kuma baya lodawa ko adana bayanan ku.","fields":{"type":"Salon suna","fantasy":"Halin Fantasy","business":"Ra'ayin kasuwanci","username":"Ra'ayin sunan mai amfani","count":"Yawan shawarwari","keyword":"Maɓalli na zaɓi","keywordHint":"An yi amfani dashi azaman kalmar farawa don kasuwanci da ra'ayoyin sunan mai amfani.","seed":"iri","seedHint":"Sake amfani da iri ɗaya da saituna don samun jeri iri ɗaya.","suggestionNote":"Shawarwari kawai: samuwa, alamun kasuwanci, sunayen mai amfani da yanki ba a duba su. Bincika kuma tabbatar da suna kafin amfani da shi."},"actions":{"generateNames":"Ƙirƙirar sunaye","reset":"Sake saiti","example":"Misalin kaya","copy":"Kwafi lissafin","download":"Lissafin saukewa","result":"Shawarwarinku"},"messages":{"generated":"Samar da shawarwarin {count}.","copied":"An kwafe lissafin suna.","copyUnavailable":"Babu kwafi a cikin wannan burauzar.","downloaded":"An sauke jerin suna.","checkInputs":"Bincika salon suna, ƙidaya, kalma mai mahimmanci da iri.","seedUnavailable":"Babu ingantaccen tsarar iri bazuwar. Shigar da iri don ci gaba.","exampleLoaded":"Misalin loda."},"additionalFaqs":[{"question":"Zan iya amfani da sunan kasuwanci da aka samar?","answer":"Kuna iya la'akari da shi azaman ra'ayi, amma wannan kayan aikin baya duba alamun kasuwanci, kasuwancin da ake dasu, sunayen masu amfani ko yanki. Tabbatar da samuwa da buƙatun doka kafin amfani da suna ta kasuwanci."},{"question":"Zan iya sake samun jerin suna iri ɗaya?","answer":"Iya. Rike salo iri ɗaya, ƙidaya, kalma mai mahimmanci da iri. Canja kowane ɗayan waɗannan saitunan na iya canza lissafin da aka ƙirƙira."}]},
